est to any object so far in its nearly decade-long travels\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states nearly decade-long travels, not century-long.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-017\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Images of the moon showed a strange object whose surface was a mishmash of peculiar features\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-018\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"Uranus itself appeared generally featureless\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-019\",\"verdict\":\"SUPPORTED\",\"evidence\":\"The spectacular news of the Uranus encounter was interrupted the same day by the tragic Challenger accident\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"Directly stated.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-020\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"the tragic Challenger accident that killed seven astronauts\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states seven astronauts, not six.\"},\n{\"claim_id\":\"B-021\",\"verdict\":\"CONTRADICTED\",\"evidence\":\"during their space shuttle launch Jan. 28, 1986\",\"evidence_source\":\"merged.md\",\"rationale\":\"The text states the launch date as Jan. 28, 1986, not Feb. 28, 1986.\"}\n]}","ttft_ms":12295,"type":"result","duration_ms":30458,"uuid":"089b1cec-c4bd-4f80-941a-77a712593c3c","ttft_stream_ms":1433,"time_to_request_ms":120,"first_content_frame_ms":1434,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
